    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Kulsoom Ghias associate professor and chair of the department of biomedical and biological sciences has been appointed as Chair-Elect of the Aspire Academy, a multinational organisation that recognises innovation and excellence in medical education. The Medical College communications team had a conversation with Dr Ghias on the new role and what exciting opportunities it brings for her and the University.",
